  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 17 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nFor the past ten years, 19 Ridge Valley Drive has been just that. A much-loved family home where children have grown up, memories have been made, and everyday life has unfolded. Now, with the children having flown the nest and the owners heading overseas, it's time for another family to begin their own chapter.\r\n\r\nAnd what a lovely place to begin!\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned at the end of a driveway, overlooking the peaceful valley and backing onto a leafy reserve, this is a home that offers a wonderful sense of space and seclusion. With native birdlife nearby and greenery as your backdrop, it's easy to forget just how conveniently located you really are.\r\n\r\nBeautifully cared for and with a sparkle of its own, this substantial home offers approximately 306m² of floor area on an 845m² freehold section. With five bedrooms, three bathrooms and a generous triple garage, there's room for the whole family to spread out, grow and enjoy life together.\r\n\r\nWhether it's a busy household, teenagers wanting their own space, visiting family or simply enjoying the luxury of having room to breathe, this home offers the flexibility that makes family living so appealing.\r\n\r\nAnd let's not forget the parking! With triple garaging and additional off-street parking, there's plenty of room for the cars, the toys and all those things that seem to multiply as the children get older.\r\n\r\nThe location is another reason to fall in love. Set within a desirable Browns Bay neighbourhood and zoned for the highly sought-after Rangitoto College, you're also in zone for Browns Bay School and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n\r\nBrowns Bay village, with its cafés, restaurants and shops, is just a short drive away, along with the beautiful sandy beaches of Browns Bay and Mairangi Bay. Motorway access is also conveniently close, making the daily commute that little bit easier.\r\n\r\nAfter ten happy years, the owners are preparing for their next adventure overseas. Their departure creates an exciting opportunity for someone new.\r\n\r\nImagine enjoying Christmas knowing you've secured your next family home, with the possibility of starting the new year in a place where new memories are waiting to be made. Settlement timing is by agreement.\r\n\r\nThe children have grown, the suitcases are being packed, and this much-loved home is ready for its next family.\r\n\r\nSwift action is strongly advised. You might just find that 19 Ridge Valley Drive is where your next chapter begins.",
